{"ref":"BDB, צֹרִי","hw":"צֹרִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צֹרִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent. Tyrian</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.14\">1 K 7:14</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.13\">2 Ch 2:13</a>; pl. as subst. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַצֹּרִים</span> <em>the Tyrians</em> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.4\">1 Ch 22:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:7\" href=\"/Ezra.3.7\">Ezr 3:7</a> (both + <span dir=\"rtl\">הַצִּידֹנִים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:16\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.16\">Ne 13:16</a>.","next":"BDB, צָרַב","prev":"BDB, צֹר"}